{"name":"Grendelle, Shimmer Hag","size":"large","type":"fey","tag":"Empowered Hag","alignment":"neutral evil","hitDice":"15","armorName":"natural armor","shieldBonus":0,"natArmorBonus":7,"otherArmorDesc":"17 (natural armor)","speed":"40","burrowSpeed":"0","climbSpeed":"0","flySpeed":"0","hover":false,"swimSpeed":"20","customHP":false,"customSpeed":false,"hpText":"142 (15d10 + 60)","speedDesc":"30 ft.","strPoints":"20","dexPoints":"15","conPoints":"18","intPoints":"16","wisPoints":"14","chaPoints":"18","blindsight":"0","blind":false,"darkvision":"120","tremorsense":"0","truesight":"60","telepathy":0,"cr":"8","customCr":"3 (700 XP)","customProf":2,"isLegendary":false,"legendariesDescription":"[MON] can take 2 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature's turn. [MON] regains spent legendary actions at the start of her turn.","isLair":false,"lairDescription":"When fighting inside its lair, Grendelle can invoke the ambient magic to take lair actions. On initiative count 20 (losing initiative ties), Grendelle can take one lair action to cause one of the following effects:","lairDescriptionEnd":"The grapple action may not happen two turns in a row.","isMythic":false,"mythicDescription":"If the green hag's mythic trait is active, it can use the options below as legendary actions for 1 hour after using {Some Ability}.","isRegional":false,"regionalDescription":"The region containing the green hag's lair is warped by the creature's presence, which creates one or more of the following effects:","regionalDescriptionEnd":"If the green hag dies, the first two effects fade over the course of 3d10 days.","properties":[],"abilities":[{"name":"Immutable Form","desc":"[MON] is immune to any spell or effect that would alter her form."},{"name":"Regeneration","desc":"[MON] regains [2d8] hit points at the start of its turn. If the [MON] takes acid or fire damage, this trait doesn't function at the start of the [MON]'s next turn. The [MON] dies only if it starts its turn with 0 hit points and doesn't regenerate."},{"name":"Amphibious","desc":"[MON] can breathe air and water."},{"name":"Mimicry","desc":"[MON] can mimic animal sounds and humanoid voices. A creature that hears the sounds can tell they are imitations with a successful DC [CHA SAVE] Wisdom (Insight) check."},{"name":"Magic Resistance","desc":"[MON] has advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects."},{"name":"Innate Spellcasting","desc":"[MON]'s innate spellcasting ability is Charisma (spell save DC [CHA SAVE]). She can innately cast the following spells, requiring no material components:\n\n\n> At will: _Guiding Bolt, Sleep, Dancing Lights, Thaumaturgy, Speak With Plants_\n> 4/day: _Blinding Smite, Ray of Enfeeblement, Blindness, Moonbeam_\n> 2/day: _Fear, Blight, Charm Monster_\n> 1/day: _Tree Stride, Dream, Transport via Plants_"},{"name":"Extraplanar Net","desc":"Creatures cannot use teleportation magic or interplanar travel to enter or leave any space within 60ft of [MON]."}],"actions":[{"name":"Multiattack","desc":"[MON] uses Sickening Radiance, then makes two Rake or Shimmerlash attacks."},{"name":"Rake","desc":"_Melee Weapon Attack:_ [STR ATK] to hit, reach 10 ft., one target. _Hit:_ [STR 2d12] slashing damage."},{"name":"Shimmerlash","desc":"A tendril of dark light erupts from [MON] and batters a creature within 60 ft. It must make a DC [CHA SAVE] Dexterity saving throw or take [2d6] necrotic damage and [2d6] radiant damage."},{"name":"Sickening Radiance (Recharge 6)","desc":"All creatures within 60ft of [MON] must succeed on a DC [CHA SAVE] constitution saving throw or take 4d10 radiant damage, suffers one level of exhaustion, and emit dim light in a 5 foot radius (making invisibility impossible). A creature which succeeds takes half damage and does not suffer any exhaustion or emit dim light. For each creature which fails the save, [MON] summons 1 _Will'O Wisp_ to an empty space within 10ft. Any levels of exhaustion and dim light go away after 10 minutes."}],"bonusActions":[{"name":"Phase","desc":"If [MON] is on the material plane she enters the ethereal plane, if [MON] is on the ethereal plane she enters the material plane."},{"name":"Blinding Smite","desc":"_concentration, 1 minute_: The next time [MON] hits a creature with a melee attack, it must make a DC [CHA SAVE] constitution save and take [3d6] additional radiant damage and be blinded for the duration. A creature which succeeds takes half as much damage and is not blinded."}],"reactions":[{"name":"Starry Gaze","desc":"When a creature hits [MON] with an attack, she can use her reaction to level her gaze at the creature. It must succeed on a DC [CHA SAVE] Wisdom saving throw or become frightened for 1 minute. While frightened, the creature also has disadvantage on ability checks. A creature can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. Once a creature succeeds it is immune to this effect for the next 24 hours."}],"legendaries":[{"name":"Piercing Tendril (Recharge 6)","desc":"_Melee Weapon Attack:_ [STR ATK] to hit, reach 15 ft., one target. _Hit:_ [STR 3d8] piercing damage and the target must make a DC [STR SAVE] constitution saving throw or take [4d8] necrotic damage. A creature which succeeds takes half as much necrotic damage. Regardless, the creature's maximum hp is reduced by the necrotic damage taken in this way for 1 hour."},{"name":"Aurora Wall","desc":"[MON] conjures a wall of light 60ft long. A creature which has not succeeded on the _Starry Gaze_ save cannot willingly approach the wall. The wall vanishes at the start of Grendelle's next turn."},{"name":"Relocate Spell","desc":"[MON] can move _Moonbeam_ or _Sickening_ radiance to another point within range."},{"name":"Guiding Bolt (1/round)","desc":"_Ranged Spell Attack:_ [CHA ATK] to hit, range 120 ft., one target. _Hit:_ [4d6] radiant damage, and the next attack roll against the creature has advantage."}],"mythics":[],"lairs":[],"regionals":[],"sthrows":[{"name":"wis","order":4},{"name":"cha","order":5}],"skills":[{"name":"arcana","stat":"int"},{"name":"deception","stat":"cha"},{"name":"perception","stat":"wis"},{"name":"stealth","stat":"dex"}],"damagetypes":[{"name":"necrotic","note":" (Immune)","type":"i"},{"name":"radiant","note":" (Immune)","type":"i"}],"specialdamage":[{"name":"bludgeoning, piercing, and slashing from nonmagical attacks","note":" (Resistant)","type":"r"}],"conditions":[{"name":"charmed"},{"name":"invisible"},{"name":"poisoned"}],"languages":[{"name":"Abyssal","speaks":true},{"name":"Aire","speaks":true},{"name":"Celestial","speaks":false},{"name":"Common","speaks":true},{"name":"Deep Speech","speaks":true},{"name":"Dwarvish","speaks":true}],"understandsBut":"","shortName":"Grendelle","pluralName":"","doubleColumns":true,"separationPoint":7,"damage":[]}